-dir>/<timestamp>/<agent>`)"},"542":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-108","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"`--format <FORMAT>`"},"543":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-109","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"`table` or `json` only"},"544":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-110","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"`--json`"},"545":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-111","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"Shorthand for `--format json`"},"546":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-112","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"`--no-fail`"},"547":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-113","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"Exit zero on suite failure"},"548":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-114","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"Folds many runs into named metrics and gates each on its own threshold, where `eval report` describes one run and `eval score` decides one run's verdict."},"549":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-115","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"A scorecard reports each measurement's own rate rather than a suite pass rate. A case carrying both a skill-invocation check and a tool-call ceiling would otherwise report a budget overrun as a recall failure."},"550":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-116","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"