s-quality/run-evals-10","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-the-suite","content":"**Runs are isolated by default.** Each case executes in a per-case scratch workspace containing only the skill under test (`SKILL.md` beside `skill-project.toml`, named by `[metadata].id`), with user-level skill discovery suppressed where the backend supports it. The `isolation:` line in the output (and the `isolation` object in `summary.json`) reports what each run actually got; a failed case's workspace survives under `<run-dir>/workspaces/` for debugging. Pass `--no-isolation` to run in the project root against your machine's ambient environment — and expect trigger rates measured before isolation existed to re-baseline on the first isolated run."},"1982":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-11","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-the-suite","content":"Common focused runs:"},"1983":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-12","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#summarize-the-run","content":"Use this for release notes and quick stakeholder review."},"1984":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-13","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#re-score-without-re-running-agent","content":"Use this when scoring logic changed and you want consistency across previous runs."},"1985":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-14","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Block merge if smoke tag fails"},"1986":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-15","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Block release if full suite fails"},"1987":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-16","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","ur