","content":"The `resume` subcommand reads the stored `optimize.toml` copy from the run directory (saved at run-start for provenance), re-validates it against the current files, and calls the training loop at the last checkpoint."},"2634":{"id":"/optimize/running-40","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#resume-an-interrupted-run","content":"**Note:** Resume uses the config stored *inside* the run directory, not your original config file. This ensures the run is reproducible regardless of changes you may have made to the config since starting."},"2635":{"id":"/optimize/running-41","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"Every run creates a self-contained directory:"},"2636":{"id":"/optimize/running-42","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"Step directories are `steps/step_{NNNN}` — zero-padded and **0-based**, matching the `step`\ncolumn in `optimization status` and the `--step` argument to `optimization inspect`. Skill versions\nare numbered by *accepted* steps, not by step index, so they diverge from step numbers once\nany step has been rejected."},"2637":{"id":"/optimize/running-43","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#run-directory-layout","content":"The run directory is safe to copy, archive, or share. Resume and inspect commands only need this directory."},"2638":{"id":"/optimize/running-44","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#see-also","content":"Inspecting and exporting results"},"2639":{"id":"/optimize/running-45","page_id":"/optimize/running","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/running#see-also","content":"Configuration reference"},"2640":{"id":"/optimize/setup","page_id":"/optimize/setup","type":"page","content":"Setup: Eval Data and Grading","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Evaluate and optim